# The bite (pitch bend): +-2 semitones by default, then the range set on the Pitch page
wait 200
midi 90 45 64
midi B0 02 7F
wait 20
expect note 6900
midi E0 7F 7F
wait 10
expect note 7100
midi E0 00 00
wait 10
expect note 6700
shot bite_down.png
midi E0 00 40
tap LFO
expect view 2
spin K1 5
expect par8 7
midi E0 7F 7F
wait 10
expect note 7600
midi E0 00 40
midi 80 45 00
wait 100
